  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OrganController
  ExplosionDistance: 0.19
  ExplodeDuration: 1
  SnapBackThreshold: 0.15
  SnapBackSpeed: 4
  OverallDescription: The human head contains the brain - the body's control center
    - along with the skull that protects it, key sensory organs (eyes, ears, nose,
    mouth), and the muscular system that drives facial expressions, chewing and speech.
    Explode it to inspect the skeletal, nervous, muscular and other systems individually.
  Groups:
  - GroupName: Skeletal
    Description: Bones of the head and skull. The skeletal system forms the rigid
      framework that protects the brain and supports facial features.
    Parts:
    - {fileID: 1568428403}
    - {fileID: 1886183979}
    - {fileID: 1058119240}
    - {fileID: 1599561405}
    - {fileID: 1350547547}
    - {fileID: 721205730}
    - {fileID: 256769400}
    - {fileID: 2029976364}
    DirectionOverride: {x: -1, y: 0, z: 0}
    distanceMultiplier: 1
    originalLocalPositions: []
    labelGO: {fileID: 0}
  - GroupName: Nervous
    Description: The nervous system - including the brain and cranial nerves. It
      controls all bodily functions and processes sensory information.
    Parts:
    - {fileID: 335489000}
    - {fileID: 1139167848}
    - {fileID: 591990564}
    - {fileID: 469877456}
    - {fileID: 199976030}
    - {fileID: 943398553}
    DirectionOverride: {x: 0, y: 0.7, z: 0.7}
    distanceMultiplier: 1
    originalLocalPositions: []
    labelGO: {fileID: 0}
  - GroupName: Muscular
    Description: Facial and head muscles that control expressions, chewing, eye movement,
      and head positioning.
    Parts:
